Package: revertR
Title: Mean Reversion- and Momentum-Based Asset Return Forecaster
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Christopher", "Smith", , "christopher.smith@promptlytechnologies.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package introduces a set of novel financial indicators that allow for quantifying momentum and mean reversion signals in terms of an asset price's distance from its major exponential moving averages, expressed as a z-score. Through the use of stratification and linear regression, it also allows for generating forecasts of future price returns.
